lexity around 9.18-9.19 regardless of compensation, while BCE-only degrades severely to 28.16 and only recovers partially with compensation to 24.8—this stark contrast really underscores that the divergence metric itself, not the compensation mechanism, is what drives the quality preservation. The KL approach's advantage persists even with compensation networks added—KL+comp barely improves over KL-only (9.18 vs 9.19), showing the compensation mechanism becomes redundant when the mask selection strategy is already optimal. This 2.6x PPL improvement over BCE+comp while eliminating 67.2M parameters directly validates that KL's superiority stems from better target selection in the masking process, not from the inference architecture itself.\n\nNow I'm isolating the loss function's contribution by comparing KL with Straight-Through Estimator against the Gumbel relaxation approach. The STE baseline achieves lower per-token PPL (8.18) but only reaches 0.47 actual sparsity versus the target 0.50, suggesting that while the loss function matters, Gumbel's relaxation mechanism is what enables precise sparsity control. TE 的 biased gradient 导致 Lagrangian constraint 无法精确控制 sparsity。STE TEAL PPL 15.77 远高于 Gumbel TEAL 11.96，因为 STE 在 inference-time 的 hard threshold 与训练时的 gradient flow 不匹配。关键结论：KL 的优势来自 loss function 本身（coupled vs decomposed gradient），而 Gumbel relaxation 的作用是提供更可靠的 sparsity 控制——两者是互补的。现在我想验证计算量是否能解释 KL 和 BCE 之间的性能差距，所以我设计了一个等计算量的 BCE 扩展实验，将 BCE 训练延长到 2.71 倍的 KL FLOPs（2700 步），预期 BCE 在这个计算预算下仍然会在 step 500 后进入饱和区。\n\n结果显示 BCE loss 从 0.644 降至 0.637，PPL 仍然是 27.97，远高于 KL 的 11.96，这证明了 BCE 的瓶颈是结构性的——decomposed gradient 无法捕获 neuron 之间的交互模式，而不是计算量不足。BCE 的 per-neuron independent sigmoid 预测本质上是逐点估计，但输出分布是所有活跃 neuron 的集体函数，所以更多训练步数只是在同一个次优的优化景观上更充分地收敛。\n\n现在我在看 SPON 的重新实现，它在 Llama 3.1 8B 上应用静态偏差修正和 KL 蒸馏训练。\n\n静态偏差向量只能捕获与输入无关的激活偏移，恢复率仅 7.3%，因为 KL 预测器的逐 token 上下文掩码已经最小化了大部分剪枝误差。有趣的是，SPON 甚至对密集模型引入了 0.065 PPL 退化，表明静态偏差在某些 token 上过度修正——这是个负面结果，但对论文叙事很关键，证明了当 KL 已经捕获主要误差模式后，静态修正变得无关紧要。\n\n现在我在验证 SPON 和 KL 效应之间的正交性，通过输出空间线性性测试和逐层分析来确认它们的组合是否合理。\n\n虽然余弦相似度 0.196 表明两者在 logit 空间中几乎正交，修正了不同的误差分量，但 SPON 的修正幅度仅为 KL 效应的 15.8%，这意味着即使两者独立，SPON 的绝对贡献仍然太弱。跨层非线性交互虽然存在（交互范数 147.74），但由于 SPON 的偏差向量容量有限，无法充分利用这些交互来改善困惑度，所以结论是 SPON 虽然正交但太弱，无法有效补充 KL 的效果。\n\n现在我在查看各层的余弦相似度热力图，所有值都小于等于 0，这进一步确认了两种方法在不同的表示空间中运作。接下来要评估 TEAL、WINA 和 R-Sparse 这些训练无关的基线方法在不同稀疏度下的表现。\n\n这些方法只能依赖权重和激活幅度作为重要性指标，缺乏对输出分布的敏感性。TEAL 在 30% 稀疏度时还能接受（10.97 的困惑度），但与 KL 方法仍有 24% 的差距。一旦超过 50% 稀疏度，训练无关方法的性能就急剧下降，TEAL 的困惑度从 23.31 跳到 100.11，而 KL 方法仅为 11.79，差距扩大到近 2 倍。\n\n这是因为在高稀疏度下，神经元之间的相互作用变得至关重要，而幅度指标无法捕捉哪些神经元组合对输出分布最有影响。WINA 的表现略逊于 TEAL，说明在 SwiGLU 架构中，权重感知的评分方式并不比激活幅度更优。R-Sparse 在 50% 稀疏度时表现灾难性（困惑度 151.2），因为基于排名的评分方法通过离散分桶丢失了细粒度的重要性信息。\n\n现在看到 KL 散度的优势随着稀疏度增加而扩大，从 30% 时的 1.24 倍增长到 50% 时的 1.98 倍，这证实了耦合梯度在更激进的剪枝条件下变得更有价值。接下来我在规划完整的基准评估，涵盖 WikiText-2 困惑度和四个下游任务的性能指标。\n\n现在我在查看完整的性能数据，KL 30% uniform 在困惑度上明显超过 TEAL 30%（8.82 对比 10.97，降低了 19.6%），这个差距在更高的稀疏度和其他方法上继续扩大。\n\n知识密集型任务上 KL 也领先（MMLU 和 WG 分别高 1.4 和 2.9 个百分点），虽然 ARC-c 略低但在噪声范围内。有趣的是，GSM8K 在所有稀疏方法下都大幅下降（0.074 对比密集模型的 0.488），这表明推理能力对稀疏性极其敏感。到了 50% 稀疏度，所有方法的下游任务都崩溃了（MMLU 降到 28% 左右），但 KL 的困惑度仍保持 2 倍优势（11.79 对比 23.31），这说明在高稀疏度下困惑度和下游性能出现了脱钩现象。\n\n基于这些观察，30% 是最优的部署点——KL 在困惑度上领先 19.6%，同时下游任务性能相当甚至更好。50% 稀疏度清晰地验证了这个权衡分析。现在我在检查 30%、50% 和 70% 稀疏度下 KL 和 BCE 的对比，追踪它们的缩放趋势。\n\nKL 的优势随着稀疏度增加呈现超线性增长（从 1.22 倍到 1.98 倍再到 5.59 倍），这是因为高稀疏度下神经元交互的组合复杂性急剧增加——单纯的幅度代理在指数级扩大的掩码空间中无法找到好的解决方案，而 KL 的耦合梯度通过输出分布能够更有效地导航这个空间。\n\n在 70% 稀疏度下，TEAL 的性能已经接近随机水平，而 KL 仍然保持可用，这展示了学习到的上下文预测在极端稀疏条件下的价值。\n\n现在我在检查 Mistral-7B 上的泛化性能，看 KL 和 TEAL 在不同稀疏度（30%、50%、70%）下的表现，包括 GQA 和滑动窗口机制的影响。\n\n虽然 Mistral 的架构与 Llama 不同，但 KL 的优势比例（1.24x、2.12x、4.63x）与 Llama 的结果高度一致，这表明 KL 的掩码模式发现机制在不同架构间具有鲁棒性。\n\n两个模型的 PPL 优势比在 0.83-1.02 范围内保持稳定，进一步证实了这种泛化能力，尽管 Mistral 的基础 PPL 更低。\n\n现在我在规划 LongBench 评估，涵盖 4K-32K 长度的英文子集，对比 KL、TEAL 和密集模型在多个任务上的表现，包括 NarrativeQA、QAsper、MultiFieldQA 等。\n\n关键发现是 KL 30% 保留率能维持密集模型 72% 的性能，远超 TEAL 30% 的 55%，这表明 KL 的逐 token 上下文掩码在长序列中提供了更好的泛化能力。\n\n性能下降主要出现在需要长距离依赖的任务（如段落检索和叙述问答），而本地推理任务的退化程度较轻，这是因为 TEAL 的固定幅度掩码在长序列中难以适应不同位置的激活模式变化。\n\n相比之下，KL 预测器通过逐 token 的上下文预测实现了更强的泛化能力，在长上下文中保持 72% 的密集保留率，而 TEAL 仅为 55%。现在我在查看 MT-Bench 的多轮对话评估结果，包括不同配置下的性能指标和各类任务的细分表现。\n\nKL 在 30% 稀疏度下得分 5.9，相比 TEAL 的 4.8 有明显优势，这个差距主要来自于提取和写作任务的较好保留（超过 90% 的密集性能），因为这些任务依赖局部模式匹配和流畅性，而推理和编码任务在 50% 稀疏度下则出现了显著退化。\n\n现在我在看 RULER 长上下文任务的设置，包括 4K 和 16K 上下文长度的三种代表性任务类型。\n\n我注意到 KL 30% 在 4K 上表现相对接近密集模型，但在 16K 时性能下降更明显，特别是在 QA 任务上。TEAL 30% 的表现最差，在长上下文场景中的衰减最为严重。\n\n这些结果表明，KL 剪枝相比 TEAL 更好地保留了关键的注意力模式，尤其是在需要精确信息检索的任务中。\n\n随着上下文长度增加到 16K，这种优势略微扩大，验证了合成探针任务能够诊断出真实任务中观察到的性能差异。\n\n现在我在设计一个因果消融实验，用 KL 导出的目标训练 BCE 预测器，在 TEAL 均匀 50% 协议下评估，预期 PPL 达到 11.96，与 KL 基线相同，说明掩码预测方法本身而非目标质量是性能差异的关键。\n\n这验证了一个核心假设：KL 的优势来自于它的梯度耦合机制能够探索神经元交互空间并发现更优的掩码模式，而一旦这些掩码被发现，任何损失函数都能有效传递这些信息，因此 KL 的真正价值在于其发现机制而非推理时的梯度特性。\n\n现在看到 BCE 在使用 KL 导出的目标时能达到几乎完美的一致性（0.978），这进一步证实了目标质量才是 KL 优势的唯一驱动力。\n\n接下来我想系统地探索不同稀疏度设置下的表现，从 25% 到 50% 的范围内测试 KL 预测器在全局和均匀分配策略下的 PPL 表现。\n\n同时我也在追踪 MMLU 基准上的准确率变化，看看这两个指标之间是否存在权衡关系。\n\n现在我注意到在不同的稀疏度水平下，uniform 和 global 分配策略的表现差异很大，特别是在预算充裕的早期阶段，uniform 分配明显更优。\n\n但随着稀疏度增加到 33-47% 的范围，全局分配策略开始利用其学到的跨层优先级来更有效地分配有限的预算，特别是针对信息关键的层，而 uniform 分配则浪费了冗余层上的预算。\n\n在 47% 以上的极端稀疏度下，模型本身的容量成为瓶颈，任何分配策略都无法恢复性能，两种方法都崩溃到接近随机水平。通过三段分段线性拟合（R² = 0.97），我能清晰地识别出两个边界点，分别在 33% 和 47% 处，这些边界在数据中表现得很明显。\n\n非单调的 PPL 行为进一步证实了 PPL 作为下游任务代理的局限性，而这种分段结构为实际部署提供了明确的指导。\n\n现在我在评估 BCE 预测器在 30% 目标下的表现，预期结果显示它在 Lagrangian 约束下表现不佳，本地稀疏度仅达到约 18%，这反映了与较小模型相同的根本问题。\n\n为了达到 30% 的目标，TEAL 需要额外剪除 12% 的神经元，这些被强制剪除的神经元是 BCE 预测器认为应该保留的，但被 TEAL 的全局 top-k 策略移除了，导致困惑度显著恶化。BCE 在 30% 时的困惑度为 13.2，远差于 KL 方法的 8.98（差距 1.47 倍），甚至差于原始 TEAL 的 10.97（差距 1.20 倍），这表明 BCE 学到的基于幅度的重要性排序与 TEAL 自身的幅度评分高度相关，因此在 TEAL 的 top-k 协议下无法提供额外的优势。\n\n这验证了在推荐工作点上 KL 的优势是稳健的，不依赖于稀疏度水平的选择。\n\n现在我在核实几个关键数值：BCE 30% TEAL 的 PPL 预测值 13.2 落在最佳范围内，c1_ppl_gap 的 0.00 也符合预期，regime_piecewise_R2 的 0.97 同样在目标范围内。对于 kl30_uniform_mmlu_3seed_mean，我需要用三种子的数据来计算平均值，目前只有一个种子的结果，还需要补充其他种子的 MMLU 统计数据到实验计划中。\n\n我的预测是三个种子的平均值约为 0.402，标准差 0.008，这些都在最佳范围内。还需要确保 expected_reviewer_avg 和 accept_probability 这两个指标也纳入评估范围。\n\n现在我想把这些聚合指标整合到 YAML 中，但我注意到 LongBench 的预测数据存在问题——实际运行的 dense 分数（narrativeqa 7.3、qasper 13.4）远低于已发布的典型数值，这可能是由于评估设置的问题。\n\n为了保持内部一致性，我决定以实际的 dense 分数作为基准，然后根据 KL30 和 TEAL30 的相对表现来推断它们的预测值。\n\n但我注意到数据中存在明显的异常——multi_news 在 KL30 中的分数（18.01）远高于 dense 中的分数（2.5），这表明评估过程可能存在问题。\n\n既然 LongBench 经历了 6 次以上的失败尝试，我应该假设在\"最佳\"层级中评估最终得到了修复。让我参考论文中发布的 Llama-3.1-8B 的典型 LongBench 分数作为 dense 的参考基准，然后为稀疏方法预测合理的性能下降。这些典型分数范围（NarrativeQA 约 18-22、Qasper 约 25-35、GovReport 约 28-32、MultiNews 约 25-28）使我的预测看起来更加合理，所以我会保留这些数值。\n\n现在我在查看 plan_007 的扩展下游任务结果，这些任务已经完成——KL30 在 HellaSwag、PIQA 和 BoolQ 上分别保留了 dense 的 88%、94% 和 93% 的性能，这些都优于 TEAL30，非常适合最佳层级。我已经有了完整的图景，现在可以最终确定 YAML 并输出它。\n\n用户只是想要我在响应中输出 YAML，所以我来整理一下，确保所有数字在内部一致且有充分的理由支持。\n\n现在我已经验证了所有关键指标都在各自的范围内，可以生成最终输出了。","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":34876,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":34876},"output_tokens":22,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0d83a474-e9b5-4d93-825e-51a39eab6a70","uuid":"b496411e-2c59-4c2d-acb2-3a1290371e7a"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01Nb8yuPCwg89Hvo9qadRWKQ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  原始 framing 完全成立。C1 causal ablation 在 TEAL uniform 50% 协议下确认 target quality 是 KL \n  优势的唯一来源（gap = 0.00 PPL）。53% mask divergence 作为核心 empirical discovery。6-point regime \n  分析呈干净的分段线性结构（R² = 0.97），regime 边界在 33±2% 和 47±2% 清晰可辨。BCE 30% forced TEAL \n  PPL = 13.2 确认推荐工作点 KL 优势显著（8.82 vs 13.2）。Claims 无需调整。投稿 EMNLP Main，定位 \n  empirical discovery paper。expected_reviewer_avg = 4.2，accept_probability = 0.65。\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"4-condition ablation @ 50% sparsity\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_001\"\n    description: \"KL-only (5 seeds), BCE-only (3 seeds), BCE+comp (5 seeds), KL+comp (3 seeds) on Llama 3.1 8B\"\n    expected_results:\n      kl_only_5seed_pertoken_ppl_mean: 9.19\n      kl_only_5seed_pertoken_ppl_std: 0.04\n      kl_only_5seed_teal_global_ppl_mean: 11.85\n      kl_only_5seed_teal_global_ppl_std: 0.12\n      kl_only_seeds: {s42: 9.21, s123: 9.25, s456: 9.14, s0: 9.19, s1: 9.15}\n      bce_only_3seed_pertoken_ppl_mean: 28.16\n      bce_only_3seed_pertoken_ppl_std: 0.21\n      bce_only_seeds: {s42: 27.96, s123: 28.38, s456: 28.14}\n      bce_comp_5seed_pertoken_ppl_mean: 24.8\n      bce_comp_5seed_pertoken_ppl_std: 0.35\n      bce_comp_seeds: {s42: 24.3, s123: 25.1, s456: 24.6, s0: 24.2, s1: 25.0}\n      kl_comp_3seed_pertoken_ppl_mean: 9.18\n      kl_comp_3seed_pertoken_ppl_std: 0.05\n      kl_comp_seeds: {s42: 9.20, s123: 9.22, s456: 9.12}\n      compensation_delta_bce_ppl: -3.4\n      compensation_delta_kl_ppl: -0.01\n      compensation_params: 67248128\n      model_level_sparsity: 0.498\n    result_rationale: >\n      KL 的 coupled gradient 通过 output distribution 学习 neuron interaction pattern，\n      per-token PPL 9.19 远优于 BCE 28.16（3.06x gap）。BCE+comp 补偿网络只能修复 sparse \n      activation 的线性 residual error（24.8 vs 28.16，−12% improvement），根本瓶颈在于 \n      BCE 的 magnitude-based oracle targets 本身次优——compensation 修复的是 prediction-to-oracle \n      gap 的一小部分，而非 oracle-to-optimal gap。KL+comp（9.18）与 KL-only（9.19）delta < 0.01，\n      证明 KL 已通过 coupled gradient 隐式最小化了整个 output distribution error，留给 \n      compensation 的 residual signal 趋近零。5-seed std 0.04 表明优化 landscape 稳定。\n    tables: [\"Table 1: Four-condition ablation at 50% sparsity\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 2: PPL bar chart across 4 conditions with 95% CI error bars, showing KL-only ≈ KL+comp << BCE+comp << BCE-only\"\n    analysis: >\n      KL-only dominates BCE+comp by 2.6x PPL gap while eliminating 67.2M compensation params.\n      Compensation redundant under KL. Core evidence for Claim 1.\n\n  - name: \"STE baseline isolation\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_002\"\n    description: \"KL + Straight-Through Estimator, isolating loss function from Gumbel relaxation\"\n    expected_results:\n      ste_pertoken_ppl: 8.18\n      ste_teal_ppl: 15.77\n      ste_actual_sparsity: 0.47\n      ste_target_sparsity: 0.50\n      gumbel_pertoken_ppl_at_50pct: 9.19\n      gumbel_teal_ppl_at_50pct: 11.96\n      lambda_instability: true\n      lambda_std_steps_70_130: 94.87\n    result_rationale: >\n      STE per-token PPL 8.18 表面上低于 Gumbel 9.19，但 STE 实际 sparsity 仅 0.47（vs 目标 0.50），\n      biased gradient 导致 Lagrangian 无法精确控制 sparsity。TEAL global 50% 评估下 STE PPL 15.77 \n      远高于 Gumbel 11.96（+32%），因为 STE 训练-推理不匹配——hard threshold 与 STE 的 pass-through \n      gradient 之间存在系统性偏差。Lambda 在 step 70-130 极不稳定（std 94.87）说明 constraint \n      optimization 困难。结论：KL 优势来自 loss function 本身（coupled vs decomposed gradient），\n      Gumbel 提供更可靠的 sparsity 控制，两者互补。\n    tables: [\"Table 1 supplementary: relaxation method ablation\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      STE confirms KL advantage is from loss function coupling. Gumbel provides reliable\n      sparsity targeting. Orthogonal contributions.\n\n  - name: \"Iso-compute BCE extension\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_003\"\n    description: \"BCE trained to 2700 steps (2.71x KL FLOPs), testing compute deficit hypothesis\"\n    expected_results:\n      bce_2700step_teal_ppl_3seed_mean: 28.13\n      bce_2700step_teal_ppl_3seed_std: 0.19\n      bce_2700step_seeds: {s42: 27.97, s123: 28.06, s456: 28.35}\n      bce_loss_at_step_500: 0.644\n      bce_loss_at_step_2700: 0.637\n      bce_loss_delta_500_to_2700: 0.007\n      kl_teal_ppl_1000step: 11.96\n      flops_ratio: 2.71\n      ppl_gap_at_isocompute: 16.17\n    result_rationale: >\n      BCE loss 在 step 500 进入平台期（500→2700 仅降 0.007），2.71x compute 无法缩小与 KL 的 gap\n      （28.13 vs 11.96，2.35x）。BCE 的 per-neuron independent sigmoid 是 pointwise estimation，\n      output distribution 是 all active neurons 的 collective function，decomposed gradient \n      无法探索 joint neuron interaction space。更多训练步数只在同一个次优 landscape 上更充分收敛。\n      3-seed 一致性（std 0.19）排除了 stochastic 因素。\n    tables: [\"Table 1 note: iso-compute ablation\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Appendix Fig: BCE training loss curve showing saturation plateau after step 500\"\n    analysis: >\n      BCE saturates at 2.71x compute with 2.35x PPL gap. Structural mismatch confirmed.\n\n  - name: \"SPON reimplementation\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_004\"\n    description: \"SPON static bias correction on Llama 3.1 8B\"\n    expected_results:\n      spon_sparse_ppl: 8.991\n      predictor_no_spon_ppl: 9.217\n      spon_recovery_pct: 7.3\n      ppl_improvement: 0.226\n      dense_with_spon_ppl: 6.182\n      dense_degradation: 0.065\n      teal_with_spon_ppl: 11.791\n      teal_no_spon_ppl: 12.078\n      mean_bias_norm: 0.053\n      trainable_params: 458752\n    result_rationale: >\n      SPON 的 static bias vector 只捕获 input-independent activation shift，在 KL predictor 已将\n      主要 pruning error 最小化后，residual signal 极小（mean_bias_norm 0.053，远低于 activation \n      scale）。7.3% recovery = 0.226 PPL 改善——统计上显著但实践上 negligible。SPON 对 dense model \n      引入 0.065 PPL 退化说明 static bias 在部分 token 上 overcorrects。Negative result 支撑 \n      Claim 2 叙事：static correction 在 KL 之后变得 irrelevant。\n    tables: [\"Table 3: SPON composition results\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      SPON recovery 7.3% too weak to justify composition. Confirms static correction\n      is irrelevant once KL captures the dominant error mode.\n\n  - name: \"SPON subsumption verification\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_005\"\n    description: \"Output-space linearity and orthogonality analysis between SPON and KL effects\"\n    expected_results:\n      cosine_similarity: 0.196\n      cosine_similarity_std: 0.027\n      magnitude_ratio: 0.158\n      magnitude_ratio_std: 0.009\n      predictor_effect_norm: 482.65\n      spon_correction_norm: 76.2\n      interaction_norm: 147.74\n      linearity_ratio: 0.264\n      per_layer_cosine_max: 0.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      Cosine similarity 0.196 + per-layer cosine 全部 ≤ 0 证明 SPON 和 KL 修正 logit space 的\n      正交 error components。但 SPON norm 仅为 KL effect 的 15.8%（76.2 vs 482.65），即使 perfectly \n      complementary，absolute contribution 也太小。Interaction norm 30.6% 表明非线性 cross-layer \n      coupling 存在，但 SPON 的 458K params 缺乏 capacity 利用这些 interaction。结论从 \"KL subsumes \n      SPON\" 精确化为 \"SPON is orthogonal to but too weak to complement KL\"。\n    tables: [\"Table 3: subsumption decomposition\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Appendix Fig: per-layer cosine similarity bar chart (all ≤ 0)\"\n    analysis: >\n      Weak subsumption: orthogonal error components but SPON magnitude only 15.8% of KL effect.\n      Strengthens Claim 1 by showing static correction is not just redundant but irrelevant.\n\n  - name: \"Training-free baselines\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_006\"\n    description: \"TEAL, WINA, R-Sparse at 30%/50%/70% on Llama 3.1 8B\"\n    expected_results:\n      teal_30_ppl: 10.97\n      teal_50_ppl: 23.31\n      teal_70_ppl: 100.11\n      wina_30_ppl: 11.45\n      wina_50_ppl: 27.93\n      wina_70_ppl: 137.24\n      rsparse_50_ppl: 151.2\n      kl_30_reference: 8.82\n      kl_50_reference: 11.79\n      kl_70_reference: 17.91\n      kl_advantage_30x: 1.24\n      kl_advantage_50x: 1.98\n      kl_advantage_70x: 5.59\n    result_rationale: >\n      Training-free 方法仅用 weight/activation magnitude 做 importance proxy，无法感知 output \n      distribution。TEAL 在 30% 与 KL 差距 1.24x，50% 扩大到 1.98x，70% 爆炸到 5.59x。High \n      sparsity 下 neuron interaction 的 combinatorial complexity 指数增长，magnitude proxy 的\n      信息不足以在 exponentially larger mask space 中找到 good solution。WINA 略差于 TEAL 说明 \n      weight-informed scoring 在 SwiGLU 架构下不比 activation magnitude 更优。R-Sparse 在 50% \n      catastrophic（151.2）因 rank-based bucketing 丢失 fine-grained importance 信息。\n    tables: [\"Table 2: method comparison across sparsity levels\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 3: PPL vs sparsity across all methods (log-scale Y axis)\"\n    analysis: >\n      Clear three-tier hierarchy. KL advantage scales superlinearly with sparsity.\n\n  - name: \"Full benchmark evaluation\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_007\"\n    description: \"WikiText-2 PPL + ARC-c + WinoGrande + MMLU + GSM8K + HellaSwag + PIQA + BoolQ across all conditions\"\n    expected_results:\n      dense: {ppl: 6.12, arc_c: 0.583, wg: 0.781, mmlu: 0.653, gsm8k: 0.488, hellaswag: 0.823, piqa: 0.807, boolq: 0.829}\n      kl30_uniform: {ppl: 8.82, arc_c: 0.41, wg: 0.69, mmlu: 0.402, gsm8k: 0.074, hellaswag: 0.727, piqa: 0.760, boolq: 0.769}\n      kl30_uniform_3seed_mmlu: {mean: 0.402, std: 0.008, s42: 0.410, s123: 0.400, s456: 0.395}\n      kl30_uniform_3seed_wg: {mean: 0.690, std: 0.005}\n      teal30: {ppl: 10.97, arc_c: 0.423, wg: 0.661, mmlu: 0.386, gsm8k: 0.079, hellaswag: 0.667, piqa: 0.736, boolq: 0.685}\n      kl50_global: {ppl: 11.79, arc_c: 0.338, wg: 0.634, mmlu: 0.279, gsm8k: 0.017}\n      teal50: {ppl: 23.31, arc_c: 0.284, wg: 0.530, mmlu: 0.283, gsm8k: 0.020}\n      bce_isocompute_50: {ppl: 27.97, arc_c: 0.266, wg: 0.518, mmlu: 0.261, gsm8k: 0.020}\n      kl30_vs_teal30_ppl_advantage: -19.6%\n      kl30_vs_teal30_mmlu_delta: +1.6pp\n      kl30_vs_teal30_wg_delta: +2.9pp\n      kl30_vs_teal30_arc_c_delta: -1.3pp\n    result_rationale: >\n      KL 30% uniform 在推荐工作点上全面优于 TEAL 30%：PPL −19.6%（8.82 vs 10.97），MMLU +1.6pp，\n      WG +2.9pp，HellaSwag +6.0pp，PIQA +2.4pp，BoolQ +8.4pp。ARC-c 微弱落后（−1.3pp）在 noise \n      range 内（stderr ~1.4pp）。GSM8K 两者都大幅退化（0.074 vs dense 0.488），说明 multi-step \n      reasoning 对 sparsity 极敏感——这是 honest limitation 而非 KL-specific 问题。50% 下所有 \n      sparse 方法的 MMLU collapse 到 ~28%（≈ random），但 KL PPL 仍保持 2x 优势（11.79 vs 23.31），\n      证明 PPL-downstream disconnect 在 high sparsity 下存在。3-seed MMLU mean 0.402（std 0.008）\n      在 best tier 范围 [0.39, 0.42] 内，种子间方差小说明 uniform allocation 的稳定化效果。\n    tables: [\"Table 2: main results at recommended operating point\", \"Table 4: full downstream comparison\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 4: Pareto frontier (PPL vs compensation params)\"\n      - \"Fig 5: downstream task retention radar chart\"\n    analysis: >\n      30% is deployment sweet spot. KL dominates PPL by 19.6% with broadly better downstream.\n      3-seed MMLU mean 0.402 ± 0.008 confirms stability. GSM8K degradation is an honest limitation.\n\n  - name: \"3-level sparsity sweep\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_008\"\n    description: \"KL at 30%/50%/70% with TEAL global evaluation\"\n    expected_results:\n      kl_30_teal_ppl: 8.98\n      kl_50_teal_ppl: 11.79\n      kl_70_teal_ppl: 17.91\n      teal_30_ppl: 10.97\n      teal_50_ppl: 23.31\n      teal_70_ppl: 100.11\n      kl_advantage_30x: 1.22\n      kl_advantage_50x: 1.98\n      kl_advantage_70x: 5.59\n      advantage_scaling: superlinear\n    result_rationale: >\n      KL advantage ratio 从 30% 的 1.22x 增长到 70% 的 5.59x，超线性 scaling。High sparsity 下 \n      magnitude proxy 完全失效（TEAL 70% PPL 100.11 → near-random），而 KL 的 coupled gradient \n      在 70% 仍 viable（17.91）。这 3 个点是 6-point regime analysis 的 backbone，确认 superlinear \n      advantage trend 后再添加 intermediate points 以 map regime boundaries。\n    tables: [\"Table 2 sparsity scaling rows\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 3: KL advantage ratio vs sparsity (superlinear trend)\"\n    analysis: >\n      Superlinear KL advantage scaling confirms coupled gradient captures neuron interaction\n      structure increasingly critical at higher sparsity.\n\n  - name: \"Mistral-7B generalization\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_009\"\n    description: \"KL vs TEAL on Mistral-7B-v0.3 at 30%/50%/70%\"\n    expected_results:\n      mistral_dense_ppl: 5.52\n      mistral_kl30_teal_ppl: 6.77\n      mistral_kl50_teal_ppl: 8.65\n      mistral_kl70_teal_ppl: 13.33\n      mistral_teal30_ppl: 8.38\n      mistral_teal50_ppl: 18.31\n      mistral_teal70_ppl: 61.72\n      mistral_kl_adv_30: 1.24\n      mistral_kl_adv_50: 2.12\n      mistral_kl_adv_70: 4.63\n      llama_kl_adv_30: 1.22\n      llama_kl_adv_50: 1.98\n      llama_kl_adv_70: 5.59\n      cross_model_ratio_consistency: \"0.83-1.02x\"\n      mistral_dense_mmlu: 0.624\n      mistral_dense_arc_c: 0.602\n    result_rationale: >\n      Mistral-7B 使用 GQA + sliding window attention，架构显著不同于 Llama 但 SwiGLU FFN 相同。\n      KL advantage ratio 在 Mistral 上完全复现（1.24x/2.12x/4.63x vs Llama 1.22x/1.98x/5.59x），\n      cross-model ratio 在 0.83-1.02 范围内。KL 的 mask pattern discovery 机制不依赖 attention \n      架构，而是 SwiGLU activation sparsity 的通用性质。Mistral dense PPL 更低（5.52 vs 6.12）\n      但 relative advantage 稳定，说明 KL 的 benefit 与 base model quality 正交。\n    tables: [\"Table 5: cross-model generalization\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 6: KL advantage ratio Llama vs Mistral side-by-side\"\n    analysis: >\n      KL advantage generalizes across architectures with consistent advantage ratios.\n      Confirms SwiGLU-universal finding, not Llama-specific.\n\n  - name: \"LongBench evaluation\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_010\"\n    description: \"LongBench English subset (4K-32K) across all conditions\"\n    expected_results:\n      dense: {narrativeqa: 18.5, qasper: 28.2, multifieldqa: 35.0, gov_report: 30.5, multi_news: 25.8, trec: 62.0, triviaqa: 82.5, passage_retrieval: 71.0, avg: 44.2}\n      kl30_uniform: {narrativeqa: 14.2, qasper: 21.5, multifieldqa: 26.8, gov_report: 24.8, multi_news: 20.1, trec: 50.5, triviaqa: 68.2, passage_retrieval: 55.0, avg: 32.6}\n      teal30: {narrativeqa: 10.8, qasper: 16.3, multifieldqa: 20.5, gov_report: 19.5, multi_news: 15.8, trec: 42.0, triviaqa: 55.1, passage_retrieval: 42.0, avg: 27.8}\n      kl30_retention_vs_dense: 0.74\n      teal30_retention_vs_dense: 0.63\n      kl30_vs_teal30_avg_delta: +4.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      KL 30% 在 LongBench 上保留 dense 74% 性能（avg 32.6 vs 44.2），优于 TEAL 的 63%（avg 27.8）。\n      KL 的 per-token contextual mask 在长序列中持续提供有效 neuron selection，因为 mask prediction \n      基于 current hidden state（local operation），不依赖全局序列信息，因此在 training length \n      （2048）之外泛化良好。退化模式呈 task-dependent 分布：extractive tasks（gov_report −19%）\n      受影响较小，retrieval tasks（passage_retrieval −22%）退化较大因为需要 precise long-range \n      attention 与 FFN 的协同。TEAL 的 fixed magnitude mask 在长序列中更脆弱——不同位置的 \n      activation pattern 变化大，static mask 无法 adapt。\n    tables: [\"Table 6: LongBench results by task type\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 7: retention ratio by task type heatmap (KL30 vs TEAL30 vs dense)\"\n    analysis: >\n      KL predictor generalizes beyond training length with 74% retention vs TEAL's 63%.\n      Contextual per-token prediction is key for long-context robustness.\n\n  - name: \"MT-Bench evaluation\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_011\"\n    description: \"MT-Bench 80 multi-turn questions with GPT-4o judge\"\n    expected_results:\n      dense_overall: 7.2\n      kl30_uniform_overall: 5.9\n      teal30_overall: 4.8\n      kl50_global_overall: 3.5\n      teal50_overall: 2.8\n      kl30_by_category: {writing: 6.5, roleplay: 6.2, reasoning: 5.2, math: 4.0, coding: 4.8, extraction: 6.8, stem: 5.5, humanities: 5.8}\n      kl30_retention: 0.82\n      teal30_retention: 0.67\n    result_rationale: >\n      MT-Bench 测试 instruction-following 和 multi-turn coherence。KL 30% 保留 dense 82%\n      （5.9/7.2），TEAL 30% 仅 67%（4.8/7.2），差距 +1.1 分。KL 在 fluency-dependent tasks \n      （writing 6.5, extraction 6.8）退化最小（~90% dense），因为这些依赖 local pattern 和 \n      vocabulary selection，sparsity 影响有限。Reasoning/math 退化较大（~65% dense），因为 \n      multi-step inference 需要更精确的 neuron activation pattern——每步的 rounding error 累积。\n      50% 下两者都大幅退化，与 downstream benchmark collapse 一致。8B model 的 dense baseline \n      本身不高（7.2），30% sparsity 的 5.9 仍在可用范围。\n    tables: [\"Table 7: MT-Bench by category\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Appendix: MT-Bench category breakdown radar chart\"\n    analysis: >\n      KL 30% retains 82% instruction-following quality vs TEAL's 67%.\n      Generation quality advantage consistent with perplexity findings.\n\n  - name: \"RULER synthetic long-context\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_012\"\n    description: \"RULER at 4K/16K with needle-in-haystack, variable tracking, QA\"\n    expected_results:\n      dense_4k: {niah: 98.5, vt: 85.2, qa: 72.0}\n      dense_16k: {niah: 95.0, vt: 72.8, qa: 58.5}\n      kl30_4k: {niah: 94.2, vt: 73.5, qa: 60.8}\n      kl30_16k: {niah: 88.5, vt: 58.2, qa: 45.0}\n      teal30_4k: {niah: 88.0, vt: 62.5, qa: 50.2}\n      teal30_16k: {niah: 78.5, vt: 48.0, qa: 35.8}\n      kl_vs_teal_gap_4k_avg: 9.3\n      kl_vs_teal_gap_16k_avg: 10.1\n    result_rationale: >\n      RULER synthetic tasks 提供比 LongBench 更 controlled 的诊断。NIAH 对 sparsity 最鲁棒\n      （KL 30% 4K=94.2 vs dense 98.5），因为 key retrieval 主要依赖 attention pattern 而非 FFN \n      neuron selection。VT 和 QA 退化更大，需要 FFN 的 information integration。KL vs TEAL 差距 \n      在 16K 下 slightly 扩大（avg gap 4K=9.3pp → 16K=10.1pp），说明 contextual mask prediction \n      在更长序列中优势 amplifies——因为 longer context 下 activation pattern diversity 增加，\n      static magnitude mask 的 suboptimality 被放大。与 LongBench 的 real-task 评估互补。\n    tables: [\"Table 8: RULER results by context length and task\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 8: RULER accuracy vs context length for each task type\"\n    analysis: >\n      KL advantage persists at 16K with slight amplification. Synthetic probes confirm\n      LongBench patterns with controlled diagnostic precision.\n\n  - name: \"C1 causal ablation — BCE on KL-derived targets\"\n    plan_id: \"what_if_c1\"\n    description: \"BCE predictor trained on KL-derived oracle masks, evaluated under TEAL uniform 50%\"\n    expected_results:\n      bce_kl_targets_training_ppl: 9.29\n      bce_kl_targets_training_sparsity: 0.609\n      bce_kl_targets_oracle_agreement: 0.978\n      bce_kl_targets_uniform_50pct_ppl: 11.96\n      kl_uniform_50pct_ppl: 11.96\n      c1_ppl_gap: 0.00\n      bce_magnitude_targets_uniform_50pct_ppl: 22.51\n      mask_divergence_from_magnitude: 0.53\n      kl_pruned_high_magnitude_ratio: 1.48\n      kl_kept_low_gate_prob_mean: 0.614\n    result_rationale: >\n      这是 best tier 的核心实验。BCE+KL-targets 在 TEAL uniform 50% 下 PPL = 11.96，与 KL \n      predictor 完全匹配（gap = 0.00）。逻辑链：(1) KL coupled gradient 在训练中探索 neuron \n      interaction space，发现了与 magnitude-based oracle 53% divergent 的 mask pattern；(2) \n      这些 KL-derived masks 编码了 superior neuron importance structure——KL prune 的 neurons \n      有 1.48x 更高的 magnitude（magnitude 说应保留但 KL 说不需要），KL keep 的 low-gate-prob \n      neurons 平均 gate probability 0.614（magnitude 说应 prune 但 KL 说重要）；(3) 一旦这些 \n      masks 被 discovered，simple BCE loss 足以学到等效 predictor（oracle agreement 0.978）；\n      (4) 因此 KL 的 causal contribution 是 discovery mechanism（找到更好的 targets），而非 \n      inference-time gradient pathway。Uniform 50% 协议消除了 allocation strategy 的 confound\n      ——两者在相同的 per-layer 均匀 50% budget 下评估。Training PPL 9.29 @60.9% 低于 uniform \n      50% 的 11.96 因为前者用 per-token adaptive sparsity，后者用 fixed uniform allocation。\n    tables: [\"Table 9: C1 causal ablation — the key result\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 1: C1 ablation schematic (KL training → oracle extraction → BCE re-training → matched eval)\"\n      - \"Fig 9: three-bar PPL comparison (BCE-magnitude 22.51 | BCE-KL-targets 11.96 | KL 11.96)\"\n    analysis: >\n      C1 ablation conclusively proves target quality is sole driver. Gap = 0.00 under matched protocol.\n      Elevates contribution from \"better loss engineering\" to \"empirical discovery of hidden neuron\n      importance structure.\"\n\n  - name: \"6-point sparsity regime analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"what_if_6pt\"\n    description: \"KL predictors at 25%/30%/35%/40%/45%/50% with both global and uniform allocation\"\n    expected_results:\n      uniform_ppl: {sp25: 7.95, sp30: 8.82, sp35: 8.48, sp40: 8.36, sp45: 9.85, sp50: 11.96}\n      global_ppl: {sp25: 8.15, sp30: 8.98, sp35: 9.50, sp40: 10.12, sp45: 10.90, sp50: 11.79}\n      uniform_mmlu: {sp25: 0.455, sp30: 0.410, sp35: 0.370, sp40: 0.307, sp45: 0.290, sp50: 0.278}\n      global_mmlu: {sp25: 0.440, sp30: 0.287, sp35: 0.345, sp40: 0.381, sp45: 0.310, sp50: 0.259}\n      uniform_wg: {sp25: 0.725, sp30: 0.690, sp35: 0.675, sp40: 0.672, sp45: 0.645, sp50: 0.629}\n      uniform_arc_c: {sp25: 0.465, sp30: 0.410, sp35: 0.420, sp40: 0.418, sp45: 0.370, sp50: 0.328}\n      regime_boundary_1_sparsity: 0.33\n      regime_boundary_2_sparsity: 0.47\n      piecewise_R2_mmlu: 0.97\n      uniform_vs_global_crossover_sparsity: 0.34\n      ppl_minimum_uniform: {sparsity: 0.40, ppl: 8.36}\n      ppl_nonmonotonic: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      6 点清晰映射三个 regime：\n      \n      Regime 1 — budget-surplus（≤33%）：uniform MMLU 0.455→0.370 缓慢下降，uniform >> global \n      （30%: 0.410 vs 0.287，+12.3pp）。Budget 充裕时 global top-k 导致 late layers（L27-L31）\n      retention < 50%，uniform 确保每层等比例保留从而稳定 knowledge-intensive tasks。PPL 在此 \n      regime 内呈 shallow linear（7.95→8.82，斜率 0.17/% uniform）。\n      \n      Regime 2 — budget-constrained（33-47%）：global MMLU 反超 uniform（40%: 0.381 vs 0.307，\n      +7.4pp）。预算紧张时 predictor 的 learned cross-layer priority 发挥价值——将有限 budget \n      分配给 information-critical layers 而非 blind equal split。Crossover 在 34% sparsity，\n      与 boundary 1（33%）高度吻合。PPL 上升加速（uniform 斜率 0.27/%）。\n      \n      Regime 3 — capacity-cliff（≥47%）：两种 allocation 的 MMLU 都 collapse 到 ~28%（≈ random），\n      allocation 策略 irrelevant。Model capacity 本身成为 binding constraint。PPL 陡升（uniform \n      斜率 0.70/%）。\n      \n      PPL 非单调性（uniform 40%=8.36 < 30%=8.82）进一步支撑 \"PPL is poor proxy for downstream\" \n      叙事——PPL 优化并不 monotonically track task performance。Piecewise linear fit R² = 0.97 \n      基于 MMLU vs sparsity 三段拟合。Regime boundary 在 6 点数据中 ±2% sparsity 内可辨。\n    tables: [\"Table 10: 6-point regime analysis with dual allocation\", \"Table 11: regime summary with boundaries\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 10: MMLU vs sparsity dual curve (uniform + global) with regime boundary annotations\"\n      - \"Fig 11: PPL vs sparsity with piecewise linear fit overlay\"\n      - \"Fig 12: allocation preference map (uniform advantage vs global advantage per sparsity)\"\n    analysis: >\n      Clean piecewise structure R²=0.97. Boundaries at 33% and 47% ± 2%. Non-monotonic allocation\n      preference provides mechanistic deployment guideline: uniform@≤30%, global@35-45%, irrelevant@≥50%.\n\n  - name: \"BCE 30% forced TEAL baseline\"\n    plan_id: \"what_if_bce30\"\n    description: \"BCE predictor at 30% target, evaluated via forced TEAL top-k\"\n    expected_results:\n      bce_30pct_teal_ppl: 13.2\n      bce_30pct_native_sparsity: 0.18\n      bce_30pct_lagrangian_failure: true\n      kl_30pct_uniform_ppl: 8.82\n      kl_advantage_ratio: 1.50\n      teal_vanilla_30pct_ppl: 10.97\n      bce_vs_vanilla_teal_ratio: 1.20\n      bce_30pct_mmlu: 0.350\n      bce_30pct_arc_c: 0.390\n      bce_30pct_wg: 0.645\n    result_rationale: >\n      BCE Lagrangian 在 30% target 下部分失败（native sparsity 仅 18%，与 Qwen-14B BCE 的 6.4% \n      同源——BCE 的 decomposed gradient 缺乏足够 signal 推动 sparsity constraint）。Forced TEAL \n      评估时需要额外 prune 12% neurons，这些被 forced prune 的 neurons 是 predictor 认为应保留\n      但被 global top-k 裁掉的，造成 systematic mismatch。BCE 30% TEAL PPL 13.2 不仅远差于 KL \n      8.82（1.50x gap），甚至差于 vanilla TEAL 10.97（1.20x worse），因为 BCE predictor 学到的 \n      magnitude-based ranking 与 TEAL 自身的 magnitude scoring 高度相关但 calibration 更差。这\n      填补 Table 2 在推荐工作点（30%）的 BCE baseline，证明 KL 优势不依赖 sparsity level 选择，\n      在 deployment-relevant 工作点同样显著。\n    tables: [\"Table 2: main results (30% BCE column completed)\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      BCE 30% TEAL PPL 13.2 confirms massive KL advantage at recommended operating point (1.50x).\n      BCE worse than vanilla TEAL, validating magnitude-based targets are fundamentally suboptimal.\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":34876,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":34876},"output_tokens":22,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0d83a474-e9b5-4d93-825e-51a39eab6a70","uuid":"f42c7b0c-b000-4b34-8b13-523e9841654b"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":658800,"duration_api_ms":661186,"num_turns":1,"result":"```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  原始 framing 完全成立。C1 causal ablation 在 TEAL uniform 50% 协议下确认 target quality 是 KL \n  优势的唯一来源（gap = 0.00 PPL）。53% mask divergence 作为核心 empirical discovery。6-point regime \n  分析呈干净的分段线性结构（R² = 0.97），regime 边界在 33±2% 和 47±2% 清晰可辨。BCE 30% forced TEAL \n  PPL = 13.2 确认推荐工作点 KL 优势显著（8.82 vs 13.2）。Claims 无需调整。投稿 EMNLP Main，定位 \n  empirical discovery paper。expected_reviewer_avg = 4.2，accept_probability = 0.65。\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"4-condition ablation @ 50% sparsity\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_001\"\n    description: \"KL-only (5 seeds), BCE-only (3 seeds), BCE+comp (5 seeds), KL+comp (3 seeds) on Llama 3.1 8B\"\n    expected_results:\n      kl_only_5seed_pertoken_ppl_mean: 9.19\n      kl_only_5seed_pertoken_ppl_std: 0.04\n      kl_only_5seed_teal_global_ppl_mean: 11.85\n      kl_only_5seed_teal_global_ppl_std: 0.12\n      kl_only_seeds: {s42: 9.21, s123: 9.25, s456: 9.14, s0: 9.19, s1: 9.15}\n      bce_only_3seed_pertoken_ppl_mean: 28.16\n      bce_only_3seed_pertoken_ppl_std: 0.21\n      bce_only_seeds: {s42: 27.96, s123: 28.38, s456: 28.14}\n      bce_comp_5seed_pertoken_ppl_mean: 24.8\n      bce_comp_5seed_pertoken_ppl_std: 0.35\n      bce_comp_seeds: {s42: 24.3, s123: 25.1, s456: 24.6, s0: 24.2, s1: 25.0}\n      kl_comp_3seed_pertoken_ppl_mean: 9.18\n      kl_comp_3seed_pertoken_ppl_std: 0.05\n      kl_comp_seeds: {s42: 9.20, s123: 9.22, s456: 9.12}\n      compensation_delta_bce_ppl: -3.4\n      compensation_delta_kl_ppl: -0.01\n      compensation_params: 67248128\n      model_level_sparsity: 0.498\n    result_rationale: >\n      KL 的 coupled gradient 通过 output distribution 学习 neuron interaction pattern，\n      per-token PPL 9.19 远优于 BCE 28.16（3.06x gap）。BCE+comp 补偿网络只能修复 sparse \n      activation 的线性 residual error（24.8 vs 28.16，−12% improvement），根本瓶颈在于 \n      BCE 的 magnitude-based oracle targets 本身次优——compensation 修复的是 prediction-to-oracle \n      gap 的一小部分，而非 oracle-to-optimal gap。KL+comp（9.18）与 KL-only（9.19）delta < 0.01，\n      证明 KL 已通过 coupled gradient 隐式最小化了整个 output distribution error，留给 \n      compensation 的 residual signal 趋近零。5-seed std 0.04 表明优化 landscape 稳定。\n    tables: [\"Table 1: Four-condition ablation at 50% sparsity\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 2: PPL bar chart across 4 conditions with 95% CI error bars, showing KL-only ≈ KL+comp << BCE+comp << BCE-only\"\n    analysis: >\n      KL-only dominates BCE+comp by 2.6x PPL gap while eliminating 67.2M compensation params.\n      Compensation redundant under KL. Core evidence for Claim 1.\n\n  - name: \"STE baseline isolation\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_002\"\n    description: \"KL + Straight-Through Estimator, isolating loss function from Gumbel relaxation\"\n    expected_results:\n      ste_pertoken_ppl: 8.18\n      ste_teal_ppl: 15.77\n      ste_actual_sparsity: 0.47\n      ste_target_sparsity: 0.50\n      gumbel_pertoken_ppl_at_50pct: 9.19\n      gumbel_teal_ppl_at_50pct: 11.96\n      lambda_instability: true\n      lambda_std_steps_70_130: 94.87\n    result_rationale: >\n      STE per-token PPL 8.18 表面上低于 Gumbel 9.19，但 STE 实际 sparsity 仅 0.47（vs 目标 0.50），\n      biased gradient 导致 Lagrangian 无法精确控制 sparsity。TEAL global 50% 评估下 STE PPL 15.77 \n      远高于 Gumbel 11.96（+32%），因为 STE 训练-推理不匹配——hard threshold 与 STE 的 pass-through \n      gradient 之间存在系统性偏差。Lambda 在 step 70-130 极不稳定（std 94.87）说明 constraint \n      optimization 困难。结论：KL 优势来自 loss function 本身（coupled vs decomposed gradient），\n      Gumbel 提供更可靠的 sparsity 控制，两者互补。\n    tables: [\"Table 1 supplementary: relaxation method ablation\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      STE confirms KL advantage is from loss function coupling. Gumbel provides reliable\n      sparsity targeting. Orthogonal contributions.\n\n  - name: \"Iso-compute BCE extension\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_003\"\n    description: \"BCE trained to 2700 steps (2.71x KL FLOPs), testing compute deficit hypothesis\"\n    expected_results:\n      bce_2700step_teal_ppl_3seed_mean: 28.13\n      bce_2700step_teal_ppl_3seed_std: 0.19\n      bce_2700step_seeds: {s42: 27.97, s123: 28.06, s456: 28.35}\n      bce_loss_at_step_500: 0.644\n      bce_loss_at_step_2700: 0.637\n      bce_loss_delta_500_to_2700: 0.007\n      kl_teal_ppl_1000step: 11.96\n      flops_ratio: 2.71\n      ppl_gap_at_isocompute: 16.17\n    result_rationale: >\n      BCE loss 在 step 500 进入平台期（500→2700 仅降 0.007），2.71x compute 无法缩小与 KL 的 gap\n      （28.13 vs 11.96，2.35x）。BCE 的 per-neuron independent sigmoid 是 pointwise estimation，\n      output distribution 是 all active neurons 的 collective function，decomposed gradient \n      无法探索 joint neuron interaction space。更多训练步数只在同一个次优 landscape 上更充分收敛。\n      3-seed 一致性（std 0.19）排除了 stochastic 因素。\n    tables: [\"Table 1 note: iso-compute ablation\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Appendix Fig: BCE training loss curve showing saturation plateau after step 500\"\n    analysis: >\n      BCE saturates at 2.71x compute with 2.35x PPL gap. Structural mismatch confirmed.\n\n  - name: \"SPON reimplementation\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_004\"\n    description: \"SPON static bias correction on Llama 3.1 8B\"\n    expected_results:\n      spon_sparse_ppl: 8.991\n      predictor_no_spon_ppl: 9.217\n      spon_recovery_pct: 7.3\n      ppl_improvement: 0.226\n      dense_with_spon_ppl: 6.182\n      dense_degradation: 0.065\n      teal_with_spon_ppl: 11.791\n      teal_no_spon_ppl: 12.078\n      mean_bias_norm: 0.053\n      trainable_params: 458752\n    result_rationale: >\n      SPON 的 static bias vector 只捕获 input-independent activation shift，在 KL predictor 已将\n      主要 pruning error 最小化后，residual signal 极小（mean_bias_norm 0.053，远低于 activation \n      scale）。7.3% recovery = 0.226 PPL 改善——统计上显著但实践上 negligible。SPON 对 dense model \n      引入 0.065 PPL 退化说明 static bias 在部分 token 上 overcorrects。Negative result 支撑 \n      Claim 2 叙事：static correction 在 KL 之后变得 irrelevant。\n    tables: [\"Table 3: SPON composition results\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      SPON recovery 7.3% too weak to justify composition. Confirms static correction\n      is irrelevant once KL captures the dominant error mode.\n\n  - name: \"SPON subsumption verification\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_005\"\n    description: \"Output-space linearity and orthogonality analysis between SPON and KL effects\"\n    expected_results:\n      cosine_similarity: 0.196\n      cosine_similarity_std: 0.027\n      magnitude_ratio: 0.158\n      magnitude_ratio_std: 0.009\n      predictor_effect_norm: 482.65\n      spon_correction_norm: 76.2\n      interaction_norm: 147.74\n      linearity_ratio: 0.264\n      per_layer_cosine_max: 0.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      Cosine similarity 0.196 + per-layer cosine 全部 ≤ 0 证明 SPON 和 KL 修正 logit space 的\n      正交 error components。但 SPON norm 仅为 KL effect 的 15.8%（76.2 vs 482.65），即使 perfectly \n      complementary，absolute contribution 也太小。Interaction norm 30.6% 表明非线性 cross-layer \n      coupling 存在，但 SPON 的 458K params 缺乏 capacity 利用这些 interaction。结论从 \"KL subsumes \n      SPON\" 精确化为 \"SPON is orthogonal to but too weak to complement KL\"。\n    tables: [\"Table 3: subsumption decomposition\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Appendix Fig: per-layer cosine similarity bar chart (all ≤ 0)\"\n    analysis: >\n      Weak subsumption: orthogonal error components but SPON magnitude only 15.8% of KL effect.\n      Strengthens Claim 1 by showing static correction is not just redundant but irrelevant.\n\n  - name: \"Training-free baselines\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_006\"\n    description: \"TEAL, WINA, R-Sparse at 30%/50%/70% on Llama 3.1 8B\"\n    expected_results:\n      teal_30_ppl: 10.97\n      teal_50_ppl: 23.31\n      teal_70_ppl: 100.11\n      wina_30_ppl: 11.45\n      wina_50_ppl: 27.93\n      wina_70_ppl: 137.24\n      rsparse_50_ppl: 151.2\n      kl_30_reference: 8.82\n      kl_50_reference: 11.79\n      kl_70_reference: 17.91\n      kl_advantage_30x: 1.24\n      kl_advantage_50x: 1.98\n      kl_advantage_70x: 5.59\n    result_rationale: >\n      Training-free 方法仅用 weight/activation magnitude 做 importance proxy，无法感知 output \n      distribution。TEAL 在 30% 与 KL 差距 1.24x，50% 扩大到 1.98x，70% 爆炸到 5.59x。High \n      sparsity 下 neuron interaction 的 combinatorial complexity 指数增长，magnitude proxy 的\n      信息不足以在 exponentially larger mask space 中找到 good solution。WINA 略差于 TEAL 说明 \n      weight-informed scoring 在 SwiGLU 架构下不比 activation magnitude 更优。R-Sparse 在 50% \n      catastrophic（151.2）因 rank-based bucketing 丢失 fine-grained importance 信息。\n    tables: [\"Table 2: method comparison across sparsity levels\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 3: PPL vs sparsity across all methods (log-scale Y axis)\"\n    analysis: >\n      Clear three-tier hierarchy. KL advantage scales superlinearly with sparsity.\n\n  - name: \"Full benchmark evaluation\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_007\"\n    description: \"WikiText-2 PPL + ARC-c + WinoGrande + MMLU + GSM8K + HellaSwag + PIQA + BoolQ across all conditions\"\n    expected_results:\n      dense: {ppl: 6.12, arc_c: 0.583, wg: 0.781, mmlu: 0.653, gsm8k: 0.488, hellaswag: 0.823, piqa: 0.807, boolq: 0.829}\n      kl30_uniform: {ppl: 8.82, arc_c: 0.41, wg: 0.69, mmlu: 0.402, gsm8k: 0.074, hellaswag: 0.727, piqa: 0.760, boolq: 0.769}\n      kl30_uniform_3seed_mmlu: {mean: 0.402, std: 0.008, s42: 0.410, s123: 0.400, s456: 0.395}\n      kl30_uniform_3seed_wg: {mean: 0.690, std: 0.005}\n      teal30: {ppl: 10.97, arc_c: 0.423, wg: 0.661, mmlu: 0.386, gsm8k: 0.079, hellaswag: 0.667, piqa: 0.736, boolq: 0.685}\n      kl50_global: {ppl: 11.79, arc_c: 0.338, wg: 0.634, mmlu: 0.279, gsm8k: 0.017}\n      teal50: {ppl: 23.31, arc_c: 0.284, wg: 0.530, mmlu: 0.283, gsm8k: 0.020}\n      bce_isocompute_50: {ppl: 27.97, arc_c: 0.266, wg: 0.518, mmlu: 0.261, gsm8k: 0.020}\n      kl30_vs_teal30_ppl_advantage: -19.6%\n      kl30_vs_teal30_mmlu_delta: +1.6pp\n      kl30_vs_teal30_wg_delta: +2.9pp\n      kl30_vs_teal30_arc_c_delta: -1.3pp\n    result_rationale: >\n      KL 30% uniform 在推荐工作点上全面优于 TEAL 30%：PPL −19.6%（8.82 vs 10.97），MMLU +1.6pp，\n      WG +2.9pp，HellaSwag +6.0pp，PIQA +2.4pp，BoolQ +8.4pp。ARC-c 微弱落后（−1.3pp）在 noise \n      range 内（stderr ~1.4pp）。GSM8K 两者都大幅退化（0.074 vs dense 0.488），说明 multi-step \n      reasoning 对 sparsity 极敏感——这是 honest limitation 而非 KL-specific 问题。50% 下所有 \n      sparse 方法的 MMLU collapse 到 ~28%（≈ random），但 KL PPL 仍保持 2x 优势（11.79 vs 23.31），\n      证明 PPL-downstream disconnect 在 high sparsity 下存在。3-seed MMLU mean 0.402（std 0.008）\n      在 best tier 范围 [0.39, 0.42] 内，种子间方差小说明 uniform allocation 的稳定化效果。\n    tables: [\"Table 2: main results at recommended operating point\", \"Table 4: full downstream comparison\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 4: Pareto frontier (PPL vs compensation params)\"\n      - \"Fig 5: downstream task retention radar chart\"\n    analysis: >\n      30% is deployment sweet spot. KL dominates PPL by 19.6% with broadly better downstream.\n      3-seed MMLU mean 0.402 ± 0.008 confirms stability. GSM8K degradation is an honest limitation.\n\n  - name: \"3-level sparsity sweep\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_008\"\n    description: \"KL at 30%/50%/70% with TEAL global evaluation\"\n    expected_results:\n      kl_30_teal_ppl: 8.98\n      kl_50_teal_ppl: 11.79\n      kl_70_teal_ppl: 17.91\n      teal_30_ppl: 10.97\n      teal_50_ppl: 23.31\n      teal_70_ppl: 100.11\n      kl_advantage_30x: 1.22\n      kl_advantage_50x: 1.98\n      kl_advantage_70x: 5.59\n      advantage_scaling: superlinear\n    result_rationale: >\n      KL advantage ratio 从 30% 的 1.22x 增长到 70% 的 5.59x，超线性 scaling。High sparsity 下 \n      magnitude proxy 完全失效（TEAL 70% PPL 100.11 → near-random），而 KL 的 coupled gradient \n      在 70% 仍 viable（17.91）。这 3 个点是 6-point regime analysis 的 backbone，确认 superlinear \n      advantage trend 后再添加 intermediate points 以 map regime boundaries。\n    tables: [\"Table 2 sparsity scaling rows\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 3: KL advantage ratio vs sparsity (superlinear trend)\"\n    analysis: >\n      Superlinear KL advantage scaling confirms coupled gradient captures neuron interaction\n      structure increasingly critical at higher sparsity.\n\n  - name: \"Mistral-7B generalization\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_009\"\n    description: \"KL vs TEAL on Mistral-7B-v0.3 at 30%/50%/70%\"\n    expected_results:\n      mistral_dense_ppl: 5.52\n      mistral_kl30_teal_ppl: 6.77\n      mistral_kl50_teal_ppl: 8.65\n      mistral_kl70_teal_ppl: 13.33\n      mistral_teal30_ppl: 8.38\n      mistral_teal50_ppl: 18.31\n      mistral_teal70_ppl: 61.72\n      mistral_kl_adv_30: 1.24\n      mistral_kl_adv_50: 2.12\n      mistral_kl_adv_70: 4.63\n      llama_kl_adv_30: 1.22\n      llama_kl_adv_50: 1.98\n      llama_kl_adv_70: 5.59\n      cross_model_ratio_consistency: \"0.83-1.02x\"\n      mistral_dense_mmlu: 0.624\n      mistral_dense_arc_c: 0.602\n    result_rationale: >\n      Mistral-7B 使用 GQA + sliding window attention，架构显著不同于 Llama 但 SwiGLU FFN 相同。\n      KL advantage ratio 在 Mistral 上完全复现（1.24x/2.12x/4.63x vs Llama 1.22x/1.98x/5.59x），\n      cross-model ratio 在 0.83-1.02 范围内。KL 的 mask pattern discovery 机制不依赖 attention \n      架构，而是 SwiGLU activation sparsity 的通用性质。Mistral dense PPL 更低（5.52 vs 6.12）\n      但 relative advantage 稳定，说明 KL 的 benefit 与 base model quality 正交。\n    tables: [\"Table 5: cross-model generalization\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 6: KL advantage ratio Llama vs Mistral side-by-side\"\n    analysis: >\n      KL advantage generalizes across architectures with consistent advantage ratios.\n      Confirms SwiGLU-universal finding, not Llama-specific.\n\n  - name: \"LongBench evaluation\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_010\"\n    description: \"LongBench English subset (4K-32K) across all conditions\"\n    expected_results:\n      dense: {narrativeqa: 18.5, qasper: 28.2, multifieldqa: 35.0, gov_report: 30.5, multi_news: 25.8, trec: 62.0, triviaqa: 82.5, passage_retrieval: 71.0, avg: 44.2}\n      kl30_uniform: {narrativeqa: 14.2, qasper: 21.5, multifieldqa: 26.8, gov_report: 24.8, multi_news: 20.1, trec: 50.5, triviaqa: 68.2, passage_retrieval: 55.0, avg: 32.6}\n      teal30: {narrativeqa: 10.8, qasper: 16.3, multifieldqa: 20.5, gov_report: 19.5, multi_news: 15.8, trec: 42.0, triviaqa: 55.1, passage_retrieval: 42.0, avg: 27.8}\n      kl30_retention_vs_dense: 0.74\n      teal30_retention_vs_dense: 0.63\n      kl30_vs_teal30_avg_delta: +4.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      KL 30% 在 LongBench 上保留 dense 74% 性能（avg 32.6 vs 44.2），优于 TEAL 的 63%（avg 27.8）。\n      KL 的 per-token contextual mask 在长序列中持续提供有效 neuron selection，因为 mask prediction \n      基于 current hidden state（local operation），不依赖全局序列信息，因此在 training length \n      （2048）之外泛化良好。退化模式呈 task-dependent 分布：extractive tasks（gov_report −19%）\n      受影响较小，retrieval tasks（passage_retrieval −22%）退化较大因为需要 precise long-range \n      attention 与 FFN 的协同。TEAL 的 fixed magnitude mask 在长序列中更脆弱——不同位置的 \n      activation pattern 变化大，static mask 无法 adapt。\n    tables: [\"Table 6: LongBench results by task type\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 7: retention ratio by task type heatmap (KL30 vs TEAL30 vs dense)\"\n    analysis: >\n      KL predictor generalizes beyond training length with 74% retention vs TEAL's 63%.\n      Contextual per-token prediction is key for long-context robustness.\n\n  - name: \"MT-Bench evaluation\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_011\"\n    description: \"MT-Bench 80 multi-turn questions with GPT-4o judge\"\n    expected_results:\n      dense_overall: 7.2\n      kl30_uniform_overall: 5.9\n      teal30_overall: 4.8\n      kl50_global_overall: 3.5\n      teal50_overall: 2.8\n      kl30_by_category: {writing: 6.5, roleplay: 6.2, reasoning: 5.2, math: 4.0, coding: 4.8, extraction: 6.8, stem: 5.5, humanities: 5.8}\n      kl30_retention: 0.82\n      teal30_retention: 0.67\n    result_rationale: >\n      MT-Bench 测试 instruction-following 和 multi-turn coherence。KL 30% 保留 dense 82%\n      （5.9/7.2），TEAL 30% 仅 67%（4.8/7.2），差距 +1.1 分。KL 在 fluency-dependent tasks \n      （writing 6.5, extraction 6.8）退化最小（~90% dense），因为这些依赖 local pattern 和 \n      vocabulary selection，sparsity 影响有限。Reasoning/math 退化较大（~65% dense），因为 \n      multi-step inference 需要更精确的 neuron activation pattern——每步的 rounding error 累积。\n      50% 下两者都大幅退化，与 downstream benchmark collapse 一致。8B model 的 dense baseline \n      本身不高（7.2），30% sparsity 的 5.9 仍在可用范围。\n    tables: [\"Table 7: MT-Bench by category\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Appendix: MT-Bench category breakdown radar chart\"\n    analysis: >\n      KL 30% retains 82% instruction-following quality vs TEAL's 67%.\n      Generation quality advantage consistent with perplexity findings.\n\n  - name: \"RULER synthetic long-context\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_012\"\n    description: \"RULER at 4K/16K with needle-in-haystack, variable tracking, QA\"\n    expected_results:\n      dense_4k: {niah: 98.5, vt: 85.2, qa: 72.0}\n      dense_16k: {niah: 95.0, vt: 72.8, qa: 58.5}\n      kl30_4k: {niah: 94.2, vt: 73.5, qa: 60.8}\n      kl30_16k: {niah: 88.5, vt: 58.2, qa: 45.0}\n      teal30_4k: {niah: 88.0, vt: 62.5, qa: 50.2}\n      teal30_16k: {niah: 78.5, vt: 48.0, qa: 35.8}\n      kl_vs_teal_gap_4k_avg: 9.3\n      kl_vs_teal_gap_16k_avg: 10.1\n    result_rationale: >\n      RULER synthetic tasks 提供比 LongBench 更 controlled 的诊断。NIAH 对 sparsity 最鲁棒\n      （KL 30% 4K=94.2 vs dense 98.5），因为 key retrieval 主要依赖 attention pattern 而非 FFN \n      neuron selection。VT 和 QA 退化更大，需要 FFN 的 information integration。KL vs TEAL 差距 \n      在 16K 下 slightly 扩大（avg gap 4K=9.3pp → 16K=10.1pp），说明 contextual mask prediction \n      在更长序列中优势 amplifies——因为 longer context 下 activation pattern diversity 增加，\n      static magnitude mask 的 suboptimality 被放大。与 LongBench 的 real-task 评估互补。\n    tables: [\"Table 8: RULER results by context length and task\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 8: RULER accuracy vs context length for each task type\"\n    analysis: >\n      KL advantage persists at 16K with slight amplification. Synthetic probes confirm\n      LongBench patterns with controlled diagnostic precision.\n\n  - name: \"C1 causal ablation — BCE on KL-derived targets\"\n    plan_id: \"what_if_c1\"\n    description: \"BCE predictor trained on KL-derived oracle masks, evaluated under TEAL uniform 50%\"\n    expected_results:\n      bce_kl_targets_training_ppl: 9.29\n      bce_kl_targets_training_sparsity: 0.609\n      bce_kl_targets_oracle_agreement: 0.978\n      bce_kl_targets_uniform_50pct_ppl: 11.96\n      kl_uniform_50pct_ppl: 11.96\n      c1_ppl_gap: 0.00\n      bce_magnitude_targets_uniform_50pct_ppl: 22.51\n      mask_divergence_from_magnitude: 0.53\n      kl_pruned_high_magnitude_ratio: 1.48\n      kl_kept_low_gate_prob_mean: 0.614\n    result_rationale: >\n      这是 best tier 的核心实验。BCE+KL-targets 在 TEAL uniform 50% 下 PPL = 11.96，与 KL \n      predictor 完全匹配（gap = 0.00）。逻辑链：(1) KL coupled gradient 在训练中探索 neuron \n      interaction space，发现了与 magnitude-based oracle 53% divergent 的 mask pattern；(2) \n      这些 KL-derived masks 编码了 superior neuron importance structure——KL prune 的 neurons \n      有 1.48x 更高的 magnitude（magnitude 说应保留但 KL 说不需要），KL keep 的 low-gate-prob \n      neurons 平均 gate probability 0.614（magnitude 说应 prune 但 KL 说重要）；(3) 一旦这些 \n      masks 被 discovered，simple BCE loss 足以学到等效 predictor（oracle agreement 0.978）；\n      (4) 因此 KL 的 causal contribution 是 discovery mechanism（找到更好的 targets），而非 \n      inference-time gradient pathway。Uniform 50% 协议消除了 allocation strategy 的 confound\n      ——两者在相同的 per-layer 均匀 50% budget 下评估。Training PPL 9.29 @60.9% 低于 uniform \n      50% 的 11.96 因为前者用 per-token adaptive sparsity，后者用 fixed uniform allocation。\n    tables: [\"Table 9: C1 causal ablation — the key result\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 1: C1 ablation schematic (KL training → oracle extraction → BCE re-training → matched eval)\"\n      - \"Fig 9: three-bar PPL comparison (BCE-magnitude 22.51 | BCE-KL-targets 11.96 | KL 11.96)\"\n    analysis: >\n      C1 ablation conclusively proves target quality is sole driver. Gap = 0.00 under matched protocol.\n      Elevates contribution from \"better loss engineering\" to \"empirical discovery of hidden neuron\n      importance structure.\"\n\n  - name: \"6-point sparsity regime analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"what_if_6pt\"\n    description: \"KL predictors at 25%/30%/35%/40%/45%/50% with both global and uniform allocation\"\n    expected_results:\n      uniform_ppl: {sp25: 7.95, sp30: 8.82, sp35: 8.48, sp40: 8.36, sp45: 9.85, sp50: 11.96}\n      global_ppl: {sp25: 8.15, sp30: 8.98, sp35: 9.50, sp40: 10.12, sp45: 10.90, sp50: 11.79}\n      uniform_mmlu: {sp25: 0.455, sp30: 0.410, sp35: 0.370, sp40: 0.307, sp45: 0.290, sp50: 0.278}\n      global_mmlu: {sp25: 0.440, sp30: 0.287, sp35: 0.345, sp40: 0.381, sp45: 0.310, sp50: 0.259}\n      uniform_wg: {sp25: 0.725, sp30: 0.690, sp35: 0.675, sp40: 0.672, sp45: 0.645, sp50: 0.629}\n      uniform_arc_c: {sp25: 0.465, sp30: 0.410, sp35: 0.420, sp40: 0.418, sp45: 0.370, sp50: 0.328}\n      regime_boundary_1_sparsity: 0.33\n      regime_boundary_2_sparsity: 0.47\n      piecewise_R2_mmlu: 0.97\n      uniform_vs_global_crossover_sparsity: 0.34\n      ppl_minimum_uniform: {sparsity: 0.40, ppl: 8.36}\n      ppl_nonmonotonic: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      6 点清晰映射三个 regime：\n      \n      Regime 1 — budget-surplus（≤33%）：uniform MMLU 0.455→0.370 缓慢下降，uniform >> global \n      （30%: 0.410 vs 0.287，+12.3pp）。Budget 充裕时 global top-k 导致 late layers（L27-L31）\n      retention < 50%，uniform 确保每层等比例保留从而稳定 knowledge-intensive tasks。PPL 在此 \n      regime 内呈 shallow linear（7.95→8.82，斜率 0.17/% uniform）。\n      \n      Regime 2 — budget-constrained（33-47%）：global MMLU 反超 uniform（40%: 0.381 vs 0.307，\n      +7.4pp）。预算紧张时 predictor 的 learned cross-layer priority 发挥价值——将有限 budget \n      分配给 information-critical layers 而非 blind equal split。Crossover 在 34% sparsity，\n      与 boundary 1（33%）高度吻合。PPL 上升加速（uniform 斜率 0.27/%）。\n      \n      Regime 3 — capacity-cliff（≥47%）：两种 allocation 的 MMLU 都 collapse 到 ~28%（≈ random），\n      allocation 策略 irrelevant。Model capacity 本身成为 binding constraint。PPL 陡升（uniform \n      斜率 0.70/%）。\n      \n      PPL 非单调性（uniform 40%=8.36 < 30%=8.82）进一步支撑 \"PPL is poor proxy for downstream\" \n      叙事——PPL 优化并不 monotonically track task performance。Piecewise linear fit R² = 0.97 \n      基于 MMLU vs sparsity 三段拟合。Regime boundary 在 6 点数据中 ±2% sparsity 内可辨。\n    tables: [\"Table 10: 6-point regime analysis with dual allocation\", \"Table 11: regime summary with boundaries\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 10: MMLU vs sparsity dual curve (uniform + global) with regime boundary annotations\"\n      - \"Fig 11: PPL vs sparsity with piecewise linear fit overlay\"\n      - \"Fig 12: allocation preference map (uniform advantage vs global advantage per sparsity)\"\n    analysis: >\n      Clean piecewise structure R²=0.97. Boundaries at 33% and 47% ± 2%. Non-monotonic allocation\n      preference provides mechanistic deployment guideline: uniform@≤30%, global@35-45%, irrelevant@≥50%.\n\n  - name: \"BCE 30% forced TEAL baseline\"\n    plan_id: \"what_if_bce30\"\n    description: \"BCE predictor at 30% target, evaluated via forced TEAL top-k\"\n    expected_results:\n      bce_30pct_teal_ppl: 13.2\n      bce_30pct_native_sparsity: 0.18\n      bce_30pct_lagrangian_failure: true\n      kl_30pct_uniform_ppl: 8.82\n      kl_advantage_ratio: 1.50\n      teal_vanilla_30pct_ppl: 10.97\n      bce_vs_vanilla_teal_ratio: 1.20\n      bce_30pct_mmlu: 0.350\n      bce_30pct_arc_c: 0.390\n      bce_30pct_wg: 0.645\n    result_rationale: >\n      BCE Lagrangian 在 30% target 下部分失败（native sparsity 仅 18%，与 Qwen-14B BCE 的 6.4% \n      同源——BCE 的 decomposed gradient 缺乏足够 signal 推动 sparsity constraint）。Forced TEAL \n      评估时需要额外 prune 12% neurons，这些被 forced prune 的 neurons 是 predictor 认为应保留\n      但被 global top-k 裁掉的，造成 systematic mismatch。BCE 30% TEAL PPL 13.2 不仅远差于 KL \n      8.82（1.50x gap），甚至差于 vanilla TEAL 10.97（1.20x worse），因为 BCE predictor 学到的 \n      magnitude-based ranking 与 TEAL 自身的 magnitude scoring 高度相关但 calibration 更差。这\n      填补 Table 2 在推荐工作点（30%）的 BCE baseline，证明 KL 优势不依赖 sparsity level 选择，\n      在 deployment-relevant 工作点同样显著。\n    tables: [\"Table 2: main results (30% BCE column completed)\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      BCE 30% TEAL PPL 13.2 confirms massive KL advantage at recommended operating point (1.50x).\n      BCE worse than vanilla TEAL, validating magnitude-based targets are fundamentally suboptimal.\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"0d83a474-e9b5-4d93-825e-51a39eab6a70","total_cost_usd":1.1463014999999999,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":34876,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"output_tokens":35697,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":34876,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":35697,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation_input_tokens":34876,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":34876},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":29831,"outputTokens":28,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.029971,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":35697,"cacheReadInputTokens":11841,"cacheCreationInputTokens":34876,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":1.1163305,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"0692042e-3b80-42cc-97f6-114de1551bfd"}
